This repository adapts work from bdenglish/skills, supplied as a repository
snapshot during development. The Iterate skill and its manifest helper derive
from the original ben-iterate skill. The original human-feedback-first,
six-phase development philosophy is retained.

The current Debate skill implements a Codex-native Luna/Terra/Astra hierarchy.
The earlier standalone review application is not part of this distribution.

